# Local-dev config for this repo's deploy / SD-stage / benchmark tools (tools/_devenv.py).
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and set the paths for your workstation. Committed files
# carry NO absolute local paths — these tools read them from here at runtime.
#
# Every var is OPTIONAL. The app and embit default to this repo's PINNED SUBMODULES,
# so an unconfigured checkout builds exactly what the pins say and the result is
# reproducible from a fresh clone. Set a var only to deliberately build something
# else. This is a LOCAL-DEV helper — SeedSigner-OS and the production MicroPython
# build assemble their own pieces and do not use these scripts.

# The SeedSigner app checkout root — contains src/seedsigner (the app package we deploy)
# and src/lang-packs (the app's bundled language packs, which we copy to the SD). This
# repo POINTS ONLY AT THE APP: it neither knows the pack repo nor builds packs, so
# src/lang-packs is the pack source.
#
# Set this ONLY to build a working tree's local edits, and know what you are trading
# away: a working clone can sit on local-only commits that exist on no remote, and the
# resulting image is then not reproducible by anyone, including you after a re-clone.
# Leave it unset for anything you intend to keep, ship, or compare against.
#   default: <this repo>/deps/seedsigner   (the pinned submodule)
#SS_APP_DIR=/abs/path/to/seedsigner

# The embit checkout root — contains src/embit.
#   default: <this repo>/deps/embit   (the pinned submodule)
#SS_EMBIT_DIR=/abs/path/to/embit

# Point the stager at a PRE-BUILT packs dir (<dir>/<locale>/...) instead of the app's
# src/lang-packs.
#
# ⚠ You almost certainly need this now that the default app source is the pinned
# submodule: src/lang-packs is GITIGNORED in the app repo (a build artifact, not
# tracked content), so a clean checkout has NO packs and the build silently produces
# an English-only image. Point this at a tree that actually holds built pack bytes.
#SS_PACKS_DIR=/abs/path/to/some/prebuilt/lang-packs

# btc-datagen checkout — PSBT fixtures for the cUR benchmarks (tools/device_scan/).
#   default: <parent>/btc-datagen
#SS_BTC_DATAGEN_DIR=/abs/path/to/btc-datagen
